            <p class="text-muted mb-0"><font class="text-200"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><br/><img src="/web/image/67407-89dcb1d2/ssl.png" alt="" class="img img-fluid o_we_custom_image" data-original-id="48576" data-original-src="/web/image/48576-722d43f8/ssl.png" data-mimetype="image/png" data-bs-original-title="" title="" aria-describedby="tooltip112366" data-resize-width="256" loading="lazy"/><br/>______________________________________________</span></font><br/><span class="base-fs"><strong><font class="text-o-color-1">&nbsp;<br/>Late Cut-off:&nbsp;</font></strong>4PM PST</span><br/><br/><a href="/assuredsupply-subscription-program" target="_blank"><img src="/web/image/147873-ff56ee4a/2026-04-21%20AssuredSupply%20PDP%20img.webp" alt="AssuredSupply Subscription Program FOR ANALYTICAL TESTING PRODUCTS" class="img img-fluid o_we_custom_image" data-mimetype="image/webp" data-original-id="147872" data-original-src="/web/image/147872-467ecf9b/2026-04-21%20AssuredSupply%20PDP%20img.png" data-mimetype-before-conversion="image/png" data-resize-width="NaN" data-quality="100" title="AssuredSupply Subscription Program FOR ANALYTICAL TESTING PRODUCTS" loading="lazy"/></a><br/></p></div>
